\widehat{LE} = & 67.35 + 5.64 \cdot I(\text{high income}) + 0.03 \cdot I(\text{FS} = \text{PF})  -5.67 \cdot I(\text{FS} = \text{F}) + \\ & 1.63 \cdot I(\text{high income}) \cdot I(\text{FS} = \text{PF}) + 8.29\cdot I(\text{high income}) \cdot I(\text{FS} = \text{F})
